    <p class="summary-title" id="ai-recovery-title">Two failure windows, one commit apart.</p>
    <p class="intro">The difference is whether the result is already durable.</p>
    <div class="windows">
      <section class="window committed" aria-label="Result committed first">
        <p class="window-label">Window 1</p>
