          <li>Redelivery finds a completed task</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="result"><strong>1</strong> model call</p>
        <p class="outcome">The stored result is reused.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="window uncommitted" aria-label="Result commit fails">
        <p class="window-label">Window 2</p>
        <p class="window-title">Failure before completion commit</p>
        <ol>
          <li>Model returns</li>
          <li>Result commit fails</li>
          <li>Claim expires; message redelivers</li>
          <li>No stored result to reuse</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="result"><strong>2</strong> model calls</p>
        <p class="outcome">The task recovers; the model runs again.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
    <p class="test-result"><strong>47 passed · 3 skipped</strong><br />Both failure-window tests passed: one asserts 1 call, the other asserts 2.</p>
